  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Techbridge - End-to-end solution for entrepreneurs in East Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A consortium of TechBridge Invest (AS and Africa), MTI Investment SE, and Sote Hub Ltd will offer an end-to-end solution to boost entrepreneurship and innovation in the sectors of blue economy and marine litter in Kenya and Tanzania. The consortium consists of established actors in Kenya and Tanzania. End-to-end solution means a complete support cycle which ensures that startups and entrepreneurs have access to a seamless progression of resources and expertise, through Innovation challenges and incubation, acceleration programs, post-acceleration supports, and fundraising/Investment opportunities.

In terms of blue economy, the project aims to support entrepreneurs that focus on sustainable fishing practices, innovations in aquaculture, and eco-tourism. In terms of marine litter, the focus will be on effective waste management, enhanced recycling, and the adoption of circular economy strategies.The project has clear gender equality targets and targeted efforts to include women in the program as well as ensuring that the ones that are onboarded get specific follow-up.</narrative>
  </description>
